@@ -0,0 +1,35 @@
+# demo-stack
+
+Pattern: dependencies + main chart + config (deps-main-config), parent chart `charts/addons`. Scaffolded with:
+
+```bash
+homelab scaffold app demo-stack --pattern deps-main-config --chart-repo https://charts.example.com/demo --chart-name stack --chart-version 2.0.0 --health-path /alive
+```
+
+## Generated
+
+| Path | Purpose |
+|------|---------|
+| `charts/addons/templates/demo-stack.yaml` | ArgoCD Application(s): demo-stack-dependencies, demo-stack, demo-stack-config |
+| `charts/addons/values.yaml` | placeholder values block |
+| `charts/demo-stack-config/` | config child chart (wave 12) |
+| `charts/demo-stack-dependencies/` | dependencies child chart (wave 9) |
+| `configuration/schema/network.schema.yaml` | `DEMO_STACK_HOSTNAME` hostname key |
+| `configuration/templates/helm-addons.tmpl` | values for every environment (version, sizing, hostname, smoke URL) |
+| `configuration/versions.yaml` | chart version with its Renovate marker |
+| `tests/e2e/demo-stack/chainsaw-test.yaml` | chainsaw e2e test |
+
+## Before the first PR
+
+- [ ] Adapt the `values:` block in `configuration/templates/helm-addons.tmpl` to the chart's own values
+- [ ] Check that `smoke.url` (`http://demo-stack.demo-stack.svc.cluster.local:80/alive`) names the chart's Service and port
+- [ ] Seed any Secret 1Password provides in homelab in `localdev/fakes/secrets.yaml`
+- [ ] Replace this checklist with what the app does and how to operate it
+
+## Verify
+
+```bash
+task verify:text                                   # level 0
+task localdev:up && task verify:text LEVEL=2       # Kind: Healthy + Succeeded, e2e
+task test:e2e -- --test-dir tests/e2e/demo-stack
+```
diff --git a/tests/e2e/demo-stack/chainsaw-test.yaml b/tests/e2e/demo-stack/chainsaw-test.yaml
